        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Alabama Slammer, Yorsh\n- Ingredients: amaretto, Southern Comfort, sloe gin, orange juice, beer, vodka\n- Places: Russia\n- Concepts: cocktails, mixed drinks\n\nFacts:\n- The Alabama Slammer is a cocktail made with amaretto, Southern Comfort, sloe gin, and orange juice.\n- Yorsh is a Russian mixed drink consisting of beer thoroughly mixed with an ample quantity of vodka.\n- The Russian word \"Ёрш\" means \"Ruffe\" and is transliterated as \"Yorsh.\"",
